  "name": "Shoegaze vocal wash",
  "desc": "A pitched diphone vowel smeared into a shoegaze wall \u2014 legato notes drowned in big room and long delay so consonants dissolve and only the melody's ghost survives. Sparse floats one slow e-minor line under a deep filter drift; full adds an octave-up halo canon and per-4 reversals with a slow breathing swell; peak jux-mirrors the whole haze and leans a fifth on the phrase turn. Low in the mix, melancholic, but always just barely legible.",
